flowchart TD
  A1[Submission package] --> A2[Intended use statement]
  A2 --> A3{Feasible with available data}
  A3 -->|no| A4[Decline and record reason]
  A3 -->|yes| B1[Protocol drafted]
  B1 --> B2[Cohort and endpoints defined]
  B2 --> B3[Metrics and thresholds pre-specified]
  B3 --> B4[Subgroup plan set]
  B4 --> B5{Panel approves protocol}
  B5 -->|revise| B1
  B5 -->|approved| C1[Protocol locked]
  C1 --> C2[Cohort extracted]
  C2 --> C3[Quality checks]
  C3 -->|fail| C2
  C3 -->|pass| C4[Snapshot versioned and environment locked]
  C4 --> D1[Discrimination and calibration]
  C4 --> D2[Subgroup performance]
  C4 --> D3[Site variation]
  C4 --> D4[Sensitivity analyses]
  D1 --> E1[Statistical review]
  D2 --> E1
  D3 --> E1
  D4 --> E1
  E1 --> E2[Clinical review]
  E2 --> E3[Limitations register]
  E3 --> E4{Acceptance decision}
  E4 -->|conditions attached| F1[Validation report]
  E4 -->|not accepted| F1
  F1 --> F2[Developer factual check]
  F2 --> F3[Publication of findings]
  F3 --> G1[Monitoring schedule]
  G1 --> G2{Drift or decay detected}
  G2 -->|no| G1
  G2 -->|yes| G3[Re-review triggered]
  G3 --> B1
  F1 --> H1[Impact analysis]
  F1 --> H2[Evidence packaging]
